---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import RegisterForm from '../components/RegisterForm.tsx';
---

<Layout
	title="Register | OncoRay"
	description="Create an OncoRay account to begin uploading X-rays and reviewing AI-assisted cancer screening flags."
>
	<div class="page-shell">
		<div class="frame register-layout">
			<section class="register-card glass-card animate-rise">
				<div class="card-header">
					<p class="section-label">Create account</p>
					<h1>Open a secure lane for incoming X-ray studies.</h1>
					<p>
						Set up your workspace in seconds. We keep the flow minimal here: just email and
						password, then you're ready to upload scans and review model output.
					</p>
				</div>

				<RegisterForm client:load />
			</section>

			<section class="register-copy animate-rise delay-2">
				<span class="eyebrow">Rapid onboarding</span>
				<h2 class="headline">A calmer front door for a high-stakes workflow.</h2>
				<p class="lede">
					OncoRay is designed for fast triage and careful communication. The interface surfaces
					suspicious regions, confidence signals, and review checkpoints without pretending the
					model replaces clinical judgment.
				</p>

				<div class="feature-grid">
					<div>
						<strong>Image-first pipeline</strong>
						<span>Upload chest X-rays and keep series aligned automatically.</span>
					</div>
					<div>
						<strong>Risk visualization</strong>
						<span>Highlight suspicious areas and route them for expert confirmation.</span>
					</div>
					<div>
						<strong>Audit-friendly flow</strong>
						<span>Every screening note is structured for follow-up and escalation.</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

